  ${c_bold}dash reconcile${c_off}         registry + .gitmodules vs GitHub reality (renames/deletions/urls); --apply fixes safe ones
  ${c_bold}dash vendor${c_off}            vendored Pyramid Schema kit vs upstream bamr87/SCHEMA; --apply re-vendors the strict-parity files
  ${c_bold}dash remediate${c_off}         merge failing + expensive workflow signals into one ranked fix queue (feeds fleet-pulse)
  ${c_bold}dash spec [check|fleet|kinds]${c_off} Universal Project Standard checker (specs/): \`check [path] [--kinds a,b] [--gate]\` one repo; \`fleet --write\` every submodule → _data/conformance.yml (feeds the repo-evolution brief)
  ${c_bold}dash harness${c_off}           six-layer harness scorecard + trip wires → _data/harness_health.yml (docs/HARNESS.md)
  ${c_bold}dash harnesses [gaps|deploy]${c_off} fleet AI-harness + schedule inventory → _data/harness_registry.yml (/harnesses/ portal); \`gaps\` prints fan-out-deployable gap repos; \`deploy [--gaps|--target N] [--artifacts csv] [--upgrade] [--apply]\` opens kit PRs via fanout.sh (dry-run default; docs/HARNESS-OPS.md)
  ${c_bold}dash issues${c_off}            three-tier issue pipeline queues → _data/issue_pipeline.yml + per-tier work orders (feeds issue-pipeline)
  ${c_bold}dash evidence <repo> <n>${c_off} build one issue's evidence bundle in an isolated virtual environment
  ${c_bold}dash secrets [sync|rotate|plan]${c_off} per-repo matrix of declared secrets/variables vs GitHub; \`sync --apply\` provisions the token contract (values from env); \`rotate --apply\` runs the weekly credential loop (audit ages, mint where possible, propagate hub-first); \`plan\` shows the ages read-only
  ${c_bold}dash config [show|audit|sync]${c_off} read _data/fleet.yml (\`show [dotted.key]\`); \`audit\` = \`dash secrets\`; \`sync --apply\` projects canonical variables onto the fleet
  ${c_bold}dash estimate${c_off}          draft client-engagement estimates from open issues → _data/engagements.yml
  ${c_bold}dash ledger${c_off}            accrue engagement actuals + variance from usage evidence (/engagements/ portal)
  ${c_bold}dash lake [sync|sessions|review|status|export]${c_off} the local data lake — \`sync\` extracts GitHub runs/jobs/steps/logs/issues/workflows/.factory into .dash-lake/fleet.sqlite; \`sessions\` extracts this machine's Claude Code transcripts; \`review\` analyzes BOTH planes offline; \`status\` reports it; \`export [--local] [--dry-run]\` ships OpenInference traces to Phoenix (:6006; docs/HARNESS-OPS.md)
  ${c_bold}dash serve${c_off}             serve the Jekyll dash locally (docker, :4000)
  ${c_bold}dash console [--docker]${c_off} the Harness Console — local control plane UI on :4001 (native venv, or the compose service; docs/HARNESS-OPS.md)
  ${c_bold}dash sync${c_off}              update submodules + regenerate dash data
  ${c_bold}dash foreach <cmd...>${c_off}  run a shell command in every checked-out submodule
  ${c_bold}dash run <tool> [args]${c_off} run a scripts/ submodule tool (forkme, stashme, ...)
  ${c_bold}dash new <name> [args]${c_off}  scaffold a new project and register it
  ${c_bold}dash adopt-release <repo>${c_off} scaffold the release-please pipeline (--all for active repos)
  ${c_bold}dash protect <repo>${c_off}    require the CI gate on a repo's default branch (--all)
  ${c_bold}dash evolve${c_off}            evolve the monorepo itself (unified-evolution.yml, dispatch-only)
  ${c_bold}dash evolve --repo <name>${c_off}  run the repo-evolution loop on one opted-in submodule now (draft PR in its own repo)
  ${c_bold}dash evolve --all${c_off}      run the weekly repo-evolution loop on every auto_evolve submodule now
  ${c_bold}dash ai${c_off}                shadow-priced Claude Code usage per repo (local)
  ${c_bold}dash ai check${c_off}          reconcile that ledger against ccusage (pricing/alias/dedupe audit)
  ${c_bold}dash ai run -- <args>${c_off}  run \`claude -p\` under the fleet.yml dollar cap, recording what it cost
  ${c_bold}dash observe [up|down|ship|status|verify|open|reset]${c_off} the local LOG plane — \`up\` starts the elk profile (Elasticsearch/Logstash/Kibana/Filebeat + Grafana) and installs ILM + dashboards; \`ship\` replays the lake's Actions logs in as ECS documents; \`status\` reports all three planes; \`verify\` re-renders ILM/templates from _data/fleet.yml; \`open\` is the Console's Observe tab (docs/OBSERVABILITY.md)
